WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:06.920
[Intro music]

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.640
ANNOUNCER:
THIS is Capitol TV.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:16.280
[Music]

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.120
JUSTINE:
Greetings citizens of Panem and welcome to District 6

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.250
My name is Justine Ezarik and I’m a district
liaison to the Capitol.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.430
As a part of the transportation hub for our
nation, we build everything from hovercrafts

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.880
– to high speed trains – to tactical vehicles
for our noble Peacekeepers.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.080
Today, I have the privilege of showing you
the capabilities 

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.800
of one of these high-powered machines.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.370
To tell us more, I’m joined by Master Engineer,
Garrick.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.860
GARRICK:
Thank you. It’s an honor to serve the Capitol.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:54.099
The SJ7 Peacekeeper Assault Transport is
a state-of-the-art military vehicle

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:56.720
capable of deploying assets to any hostile
environment.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.981
JUSTINE:
Well it’s certainly impressive. Tell us more.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.950
GARRICK:
The SJ7’s advanced suspension can handle

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.910
any terrain with ease.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:10.680
The powertrain outputs 827 brake horsepower
from a liquid-cooled Grantham 12 engine.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.500
The windows are equipped with 70 millimeter
bulletproof glass.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.429
The armor can withstand high caliber small
arms fire, shrapnel, and explosives up to

00:01:19.429 --> 00:01:23.580
a K5 rating. [Explosions in background]

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.840
The V-hull design protects passengers even
if a detonation occurs 

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.680
directly beneath the vehicle.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.560
But I suggest we climb aboard, and experience
the vehicle firsthand.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:38.620
[Engine noise, dramatic music]

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.200
[Door closes, Peacekeepers pat on door]

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.520
[Sounds of engine, dramatic music]

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.040
JUSTINE:
Thank you for your attention, citizens.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.440
We hope you’ve enjoyed watching one of the
many ways District 6 great

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.040
contributes to our nation.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.950
Love your labor, take pride in your task.
Our future is in your hands.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:12.920
And don’t forget to register for updates
from Capitol TV...it’s mandatory.

